   "backdrop": null,
   "prompt": "Build calorie and macro progress cards like MyFitnessPal's.\n- Cards: 2 #FFFFFF cards, 362 pt wide, 15 pt corners, 24 pt padding, 7 pt apart; 113 and 105 pt tall.\n- Labels: Inter 400, 14.5 pt, #000000, baseline 37 pt from the top.\n- Calories: 976 cal in Inter 700, 20 pt, then / 2,074 at 12.5 pt #6C6C70; 1,098 left right-aligned on that baseline.\n- Calorie bar: 314 x 8 pt, 4 pt corners, track #ECEBF1, fill #2583FF, 81 pt from the top.\n- Macros: 3 columns of 94 pt, 16 pt gaps. Values Inter 700, 14.5 pt; goals 12.5 pt #6C6C70. Bars: carbs #2CB9B1, fat #6C0D8F, protein #FEB13D.\n- Swap button: 24 pt #F6F6F8 circle, 6 pt from the top right, 2 black arrows, 44 pt tap target, pressed #E8E8ED.\n- Data rule: fill = value / goal, capped at 100%; left = goal minus value. Grow fills from 0 in 600 ms.\nSwap in my brand colors and font; keep the sizes."
