   "prompt": "Build a prefilled reminder sheet like MyFitnessPal's.\n- Sheet: 393 x 358 pt, #F6F7F9, 16 pt top corners, on a 10% black backdrop, plus a 34 pt home inset.\n- Close: 14 pt X, 2 pt #0C121C strokes, 24 pt in from the top left, 44 pt tap target.\n- Title: Inter 400, 24 pt on 32 pt lines, #0C121C, centered, 300 pt max width, baselines 89 and 121 pt.\n- Subtitle and helper: Inter 400, 14 pt, #1F2732, centered.\n- Fields: 2 boxes, 160 x 56 pt, 10 pt apart, 2 pt #BEC5CF border, 6 pt corners, 15 pt left padding. Values Inter 600, 16.4 pt, #0064EC.\n- Button: 361 x 48 pt #0066EE pill at 288 pt, Inter 700, 16 pt, #FFFFFF.\n- States: focused field border #0066EE; pressed button #0055CC at scale 0.98. Values arrive prefilled, so the button starts enabled.\n- Data rule: prefill day and time from the most frequent log slot.\nSwap in my brand colors and font; keep the sizes."
